   "idx": 4,
   "zh": "首先，我代表中国政府和中国人民，对大家的到来表示诚挚欢迎！向在座各位，向全国各族人民和世界各国人民，致以胜利纪念日的热烈祝贺！",
   "en": "At the outset, on behalf of the Chinese government and people, let me extend a hearty welcome to you all. My warmest congratulations to all those present, to our fellow compatriots of all ethnic groups, and to the people around the world, on this victory commemoration day.",
   "kind": "para",
